          "address": "0c08e842",
          "type": "PLATE",
          "text": "flash_erase_sector(addr): AMD CFI AA/55/80/AA/55/30 via 0x20000AAA/0x20000554 (uncached CS0). 0x0C08E8AE = flash_program_word(addr,data): AA/55/A0."
